   "source": [
    "## Cell 8 — Extended Analysis: Dynamic RRF WITHOUT Security Filtering\n",
    "\n",
    "The results above show that dynamic α brings no improvement over static α=0.5 when both pipelines use the Asymmetric Security Filtering. The hypothesis is that RBAC pre/post-filtering absorbs the noise-reduction role.\n",
    "\n",
    "To **empirically validate** this hypothesis, we now run the same 16 queries on **unsecured** pipelines (no RBAC filtering) and compare the dynamic router's impact in both environments.\n",
    "\n",
    "**4 conditions:**\n",
    "- Secure + baseline (α=0.5)\n",
    "- Secure + dynamic (α from router)\n",
    "- Unsecured + baseline (α=0.5) — full 228-chunk corpus competes\n",
    "- Unsecured + dynamic (α from router) — full 228-chunk corpus competes"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "9939c3cc",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-04-17T09:37:01.072964Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-04-17T09:37:01.072964Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-04-17T09:37:01.082469Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-04-17T09:37:01.081966Z"
    }
   },
